S6, inheritance is achieved using the ')Tj (class)Tj (' and ')Tj (extends)Tj (' keywords.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 56 271 cm .117647 .160784 .231373 rg BT 13.5 TL/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4.5 Tm (1. Single Inheritance: A single derived class inherits from one parent class \(e.g., Bird -)Tj (> Parrot\).)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 56 240 cm .117647 .160784 .231373 rg BT 13.5 TL/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 18 Tm (2. Multilevel Inheritance: A class extends a derived class, creating an inheritance chain \(e.g., Tree -)Tj (> FruitTree -)Tj (>)Tj T* (MangoTree\).)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 56 209 cm .117647 .160784 .231373 rg BT 13.5 TL/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 18 Tm (3. Hierarchical Inheritance: Multiple child classes inherit from the same parent base class \(e.g., Instrument -)Tj (> Guitar,)Tj T* (Instrument -)Tj (> Piano\).)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 56 175 cm .117647 .160784 .231373 rg BT 13.5 TL/F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 18 Tm (Application Flow:)Tj/F1 9 Tf T* (Base Class Definition -)Tj (> Child Class Extends Base -)Tj (> Object Instantiation -)Tj (> Method Execution -)Tj (> Terminal Output)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 56 168.5 cm .796078 .835294 .882353 RG 1 J .5 w 0 0 m 500 0 l S Q q 1 0 0 1 56 141.5 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 15 TL/F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm (5. ALGORITHM / PROCEDURE)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 56 123 cm .117647 .160784 .231373 rg BT 13.5 TL/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4.5 Tm (1. Create an assignments directory and create the subfolder inheritencetypes.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 56 92 cm .117647 .160784 .231373 rg BT 13.5 TL/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 18 Tm (2. Create single.js: Define base class Bird with method fly\(\), extend Parrot from Bird with method speak\(\), instantiate Parrot)Tj T* (and invoke fly\(\) and speak\(\).)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 56 61 cm .117647 .160784 .231373 rg BT -.10375 Tw 13.5 TL/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 18 Tm (3. Create multilevel.js: Define Tree class with grow\(\), extend FruitTree with fruit\(\), extend MangoTree with mango\(\), instantiate)Tj T* 0 Tw (MangoTree and invoke grow\(\), fruit\(\), and mango\(\).)Tj T* ET Q q .796078